---
title: "Hardscaping"
description: "Paver patio repairs, retaining wall maintenance, and precision walkway edging to define your outdoor space."
ogUrl: services/hardscaping.html
root: "../"
active: "services"
ogImage: "https://property-care.pages.dev/images/walkwayafter.webp"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Services"
    url: "/services"
  - name: "Hardscaping"
    url: "/services/hardscaping"
faq:
  - q: "Can hardscaping help with drainage issues?"
    a: "Yes — a properly graded walkway or patio with the right gravel base is one of the most effective ways to redirect water away from a foundation or low spot."
  - q: "How long does a retaining wall last?"
    a: "A well-built stacked stone retaining wall, properly drained, typically lasts decades with only occasional maintenance."
  - q: "Do you offer free estimates for hardscaping projects?"
    a: "Yes — hardscaping projects vary widely in scope, so we always start with an on-site visit and a free, no-obligation estimate."
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  {% include "icons.njk" %}
  {% include "nav.njk" %}
<main id="main">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section" style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="../index.html">Home</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <a href="../services.html">Services</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="current">Hardscaping</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-label">Service</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Hardscaping</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Paver patio repairs, retaining wall maintenance, and precision walkway edging to define your outdoor space.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a href="../contact.html" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="btn-ghost">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICE DETAIL -->
  <section style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="service-detail-layout">
        <div class="service-detail-main" data-aos="fade-up">
          <p class="lead">Hardscaping is where structure meets style — patios, walkways, and retaining walls that hold up to weather and foot traffic while giving your property a defined, finished look. We handle everything from drainage-driven walkway builds to full retaining wall construction.</p>

          <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">What's included</h3>
          <ul class="service-include-list">
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Flagstone and paver walkway installation</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Retaining wall construction and repair</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Paver patio installation and re-leveling</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Drainage-focused grading and gravel base work</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Stone edging for beds and borders</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Structural assessment for sloped or erosion-prone areas</span></li>
          </ul>

      <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-label">From Our Portfolio</p>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Related projects</h3>
        <div class="related-portfolio-strip">
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <img src="../images/walkwayafter.webp" alt="Custom flagstone walkway with high-drainage gravel base" loading="lazy" srcset="../images/responsive/walkwayafter-480.webp 480w, ../images/walkwayafter.webp 790w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Stone Walkway</h5>
            <span>Hardscaping · Longmont, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="../portfolio.html" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <img src="../images/wallafter.webp" alt="Completed structural retaining wall" loading="lazy" srcset="../images/responsive/wallafter-480.webp 480w, ../images/responsive/wallafter-800.webp 800w, ../images/responsive/wallafter-1200.webp 1200w, ../images/wallafter.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Retaining Wall</h5>
            <span>Landscaping · Boulder, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem">
          <a href="../portfolio.html" class="btn-primary">View Full Portfolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="service-sidebar" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul class="service-sidebar-list">
          {% for cs in services %}{% if cs.slug != page.fileSlug %}
          <li><a href="{{ cs.slug }}.html">{{ cs.title }}</a></li>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <a href="../contact.html" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
          <div class="service-sidebar-contact">
            Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" style="background:var(--straw);">
    <div class="section">
      <p class="section-label">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Hardscaping <em>FAQs</em></h2>
      <div class="faq-container" data-aos="fade-up">
        {% for item in faq %}
        <div class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 100 }}">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-question">{{ item.q }}</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BADGES -->
  <section id="trust" style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section" style="padding:3rem 2.5rem;">
      <div class="trust-badges">
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-shield"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Licensed & Insured</strong><br><small>Full coverage protection</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>5-Star Rated</strong><br><small>Serving local homeowners since 2014</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-people"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Local & Reliable</strong><br><small>Boulder County &amp; beyond</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-bolt"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Quick Response</strong><br><small>24-hour reply guarantee</small></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "cta-estimate.njk" %}
</main>
  {% include "footer.njk" %}
  {% include "scripts.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
